<title>SINGAPORE: Clipsal sets up subsidiary in Middle East.</title>
<headline>Clipsal sets up subsidiary in Middle East.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Clipsal Industries Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday it was setting up a new subsidiary in the Middle East to market and trade electrical installation products.</p>
<p>Clipsal will own 60 percent of Clipsal Middle East FZE, which will handle the distribution of the group's products for the Middle East region. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-870-3080</p>
</text>
